=== array sort reverse indexof
DIM a[5] AS INTEGER
a[0]=5 : a[1]=2 : a[2]=8 : a[3]=1 : a[4]=2
SORT(a)
PRINT a[0]
PRINT a[4]
PRINT ARRAY_INDEXOF(a, 8)
REVERSE(a)
PRINT a[0]
--- erwartet
1
8
4
8

=== array method syntax
